and am the author of <em>Platform Urbanism</em> (Palgrave Macmillan, 2019).
        Currently a <a href="https://www.rmit.edu.au">Vice Chancellor's Senior Research Fellow</a> at RMIT University. PhD in public history. This is a kind of scratch pad for my work today. 
      </p>
      <div class="socials">
